@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core. Manual applications stay in MVP regardless of a historical communication filename.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M06 — Proposed manual application progress
state "Preparing" as Preparing
state "Ready" as Ready
state "Submitted" as Submitted
state "Interview" as Interview
state "Offer" as Offer
state "Rejected" as Rejected
state "Withdrawn" as Withdrawn
[*] --> Preparing : scoped initial context
Preparing --> Ready : SM-T027 preparation reviewed\n[reviewed readiness]
Ready --> Submitted : SM-T028 actual submission recorded\n[actual event recorded]
Submitted --> Interview : SM-T029 interview progress recorded\n[explicit progress]
Submitted --> Offer : SM-T030 offer progress recorded\n[explicit progress]
Interview --> Offer : SM-T031 offer progress recorded\n[explicit progress]
Submitted --> Rejected : SM-T032 rejection recorded\n[explicit progress]
Interview --> Rejected : SM-T033 rejection recorded\n[explicit progress]
Submitted --> Withdrawn : SM-T034 withdrawal recorded\n[explicit progress]
Interview --> Withdrawn : SM-T035 withdrawal recorded\n[explicit progress]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
note "MVP manual application: status, next action and follow-up date.\nPreserve actual submitted materials; no mail/calendar dependency." as MVPFollowUp
@enduml
